<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Humanity should reject technology as it exposes us to discord and cataclysm.-->
  <VQE_Technophobia.description>传播我们的信仰是我们的责任，即使是通过武力。</VQE_Technophobia.description>
  <VQE_Technophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_Technophobic)        ->[deity0_name] taught humanity to survive through the strength of their hands and the purity of nature, warning that machines would only bring ruin.-->
    <li>creation(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name]在凡人中指定了一些十字军来执行[deity0_possessive]的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Technophobic)  ->When humanity turned to machines, [deity0_name] wept and unleashed storms to sweep away the taint of their arrogance.-->
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 对所有 [memberNamePlural] 说，“异教徒必须接受我的话，否则就会灭亡。”</li>
    <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_Technophobic)           ->The [memberNamePlural] gathered in the shadow of [place_name], a place untouched by machines, and pledged themselves to the ways of simplicity and balance.-->
    <li>intro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[memberNamePlural] 在 [place_summary] [place_name] 上建造了一个伟大的 [altarName]，因此很多人都会屈服于 [deity0_name] 的意愿。</li>
    <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_Technophobic)        ->A cruel [foeLeader] sought to spread machines into the sacred lands of the [memberNamePlural], sparking a desperate struggle for survival.-->
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 一个胆小鬼 [foeLeader] 试图否认 [deity0_name] 的意愿，告诉 [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] 割掉任何谈论 [deity0_type] 的人的舌头。</li>
    <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_Technophobic)     ->A [place_job] named [founderName] led the charge against the [foeSoldiers], armed only with tools of the earth and the strength of [founder_possessive] followers.-->
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 以 [deity0_possessive] 坚定的决心祝福名为 [founderName] 的 [place_job]，当 [founder_pronoun] 说话时，没有人可以转身。</li>
    <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_Technophobic)         ->[founderName] rallied the [memberNamePlural] to destroy the factories of the [foeLeader], cleansing the land of machinery and restoring harmony.-->
    <li>victory(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[founderName]屠杀了许多[foeSoldiers]并残酷地折磨了幸存者，以展示[deity0_name]的力量。他们痛苦的呼喊将永远提醒我们那些否认[deity0_name]的人的命运。</li>
    <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_Technophobic)           ->[founderName] saw the collapse of a society built on machines and vowed to prevent humanity from repeating its mistakes.-->
    <li>setup(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;我们的创始人 [founderName] 是一位伟大的革命者和天才，在 [founder_pronoun] 穿梭于各个城市之间时，改变了数千人的信仰。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_Technophobic)    ->[founderName] gathered like-minded individuals, teaching them to reject technology and embrace a self-reliant life in harmony with nature.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;信徒们在城市和机构之间流动，传播新秩序的消息并战斗反对那些不同意的人。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_Technophobic)         ->The elders taught me a truth that echoed through the ages:-->
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 在传播我们的理念的这些年里，我学到了一个重要的教训：</li>
    <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_Technophobic)              ->reliance on machines breeds fragility, and only through simplicity can we endure-->
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;除了我们的真理，没有任何真理。我们不能让任何人妨碍我们。他们要么同意，要么死</li>
    <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Technophobic) ->I saw it with my own eyes when the great cities fell, powerless in the face of their own hubris.-->
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;这就是我们需要传播、传播、传播的事实。如果有必要，可以用武力。</li>
    <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_Technophobic)    ->The archotechs turned away from humanity, seeing us as slaves to our machines. Only by abandoning technology can we regain their favor.-->
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; Archotechs 从天空和心灵中宣布他们的存在，并且他们的存在必须成为普遍真理。</li>
    <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_Technophobic)     ->Machines dull the spirit and weaken the mind, driving humanity further from the enlightenment of the archotechs.-->
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;Archotechs 必须被服从，我们有责任让他人屈服于他们的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_Technophobic) ->[inTheEnd], only those who live pure, machine-free lives will be spared when the archotechs cleanse the world.-->
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[inTheEnd]，考古技术人员将向 [relic0_name] 的持有者表达他们最后的智慧。凡是不听话的人都必须被清除。</li>
    <!--EN: animistBasis(tag=meme_Technophobic)    ->Every living thing has a spirit, and the soulless machines disrupt the harmony of the natural world.-->
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 灵魂想要被人认识，但只与少数人交谈。我们会让任何阻碍我们的人敬畏神灵的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_Technophobic)     ->The spirits of the earth grow weak where machines tread, their power siphoned and corrupted.-->
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;[itIsSaid]我们将向他们学习，并利用这些知识来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: animistProphecy(tag=meme_Technophobic) ->[itIsSaid] that when the last machine falls silent, the spirits will return and heal the world.-->
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;我们将获得他们的可怕知识，并用它来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact(tag=meme_Technophobic)->Machines are the heralds of the apocalypse, and their creations will poison the earth until nothing is left but ash and ruin.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;有了这些知识，我们将比这个星球上的其他居民拥有明显的优势，并用它来清除肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismProphecy(tag=meme_Technophobic)->[inTheEnd], the machines will turn against their creators, bringing devastation until only those who shun technology remain.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;什么都不会剩下。肮脏的异教徒将被原子火和致命疾病所清除。</li>
    <!--EN: introMemo(tag=meme_Technophobic)->To: All Staff\nFrom: Office of Sustainability\nSubject: Policy Update - Technology Usage\n\nEffective immediately, all non-essential machinery is to be phased out. Remember, our ancestors thrived without these devices, and so can we. Continued reliance on technology undermines our resilience and poses long-term risks to our sustainability goals. Let's lead by example and demonstrate the strength of self-reliance. Compliance will be closely monitored.-->
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt; 如您所知，我们公司的使命太重要了，不能让其他人妨碍我们，因此我们正在准备一次敌意合并，以摆脱这些……不受欢迎的竞争对手。</li>
    <!--EN: chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_Technophobic)->[itIsSaid] that the machines are mere tools of the dark forces below, and every gear turned brings us closer to their dominion.-->
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;我们需要用武力传播这些生物的现实，这些生物是人类在整个环域播下的种子。</li>
    <!--EN: serketistProphecy(tag=meme_Technophobic)->The insects thrive without machines, a lesson in resilience that humanity has forgotten.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_Fleshcrafting)-&gt;我们将塑造我们的身体，将它们扭曲成噩梦般的形状，从而带来万物的终结。</li>
    <!--EN: alienistProphecy(tag=meme_Technophobic)->It was machines that created these terrifying creatures, and as such we must reject technology as a source of great evil.-->
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_Fleshcrafting)-&gt;公司关于自残和血肉制作的政策非常明确：如果有助于盈利，那就继续。请稍后打扫会议室。</li>
  </VQE_Technophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
